<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">First Turkic Khaganate</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as First Khaganate</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The First Turkic Khaganate was the empire founded by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashina-clan">Ashina clan</a> in 552 after the overthrow of the Rouran. It quickly extended across the Eurasian steppe from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manchuria">Manchuria</a> to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/black-sea">Black Sea</a>, before splitting into eastern and western khaganates. It is the first phase of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gokturk-khaganate">Gokturk Empire</a>.</p></div>
